- !<Text/accb0803-1cc0-4985-971f-1b559fc21d12>
  PrefabRemaps:
    []
  Name: Text
  Enabled: true
  RenderOrder: 11
  StretchMode: Stretch
  VerticalAlignment: Center
  HorizontalAlignment: Left
  MeshShadowMode: None
  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    Depth Cache asks Gemini about what you see and places labels on the real objects around you.
    
    Pinch the microphone and ask a question, like "What objects do you see?". The Lens saves the depth of that moment, so labels land in the right place when the answer arrives a few seconds later.
    
    It needs a Remote Service Gateway token.
  CustomMaterial: !<reference> 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
  Editable: false
  ShowEditingPreview: true
  TouchHandler: !<reference> 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
  EnableRichText: false
  SizeToFit: false
  FontSize: 60.000000
  FontSource: !<reference> 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
